      "id": "claim_3830398e400e4d819baff0e2ec607665",
      "statement": "The wiki is regenerated by .github/workflows/openwiki-update.yml on a daily schedule (cron 0 19 UTC, 04:00 KST) and on workflow_dispatch with a boolean force input, no longer on push; a detect step diffs the baseline gitHead from openwiki/.last-update.json against HEAD excluding openwiki/**, AGENTS.md, CLAUDE.md and the workflow file and skips every later step when nothing else changed unless force is set; the run uses openwiki code --update --print with OPENWIKI_PROVIDER anthropic, the ANTHROPIC_API_KEY secret and the model from repository variable OPENWIKI_MODEL_ID (default claude-opus-5), and opens a pull request on branch openwiki/update via peter-evans/create-pull-request, with the baseline advancing only when that PR is merged.",
